# Read rules first

Before exploring code, editing, running commands, or answering implementation questions:

1. Read every file in `.cursor/rules/` (this folder).
2. Read `AGENTS.md` and follow it (including Next.js docs under `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` when touching Next).
3. Only then start the task.

Do not skip this for “quick” fixes. Incident class we already hit: WhatsApp outbound spam from a stale worker + schema drift.
